Enhance your Deadly Poison with a stoning agent.  Whenever you apply Deadly Poison, you afflict your target with an additional earth-based poison that inflicts [12, 14, 15, 16, 16 (VILE POISONS TL1-5; CUN 100)] nature damage per turn (stacking up to [51, 56, 61, 64, 67 (VILE POISONS TL1-5; CUN 100)] damage per turn) for [6, 6, 7, 7, 8 (VILE POISONS TL1-5)] turns.

After either [9, 6, 4, 4, 3 (VILE POISONS TL1-5)] turns or the poison has run its course (<100% chance, see effect description), the target will be turned to stone for [3, 3, 3, 3, 4 (VILE POISONS TL1-5)] turns.

The damage scales with your Cunning.
